    },
    {
      "id": "p1-b04",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "高级威胁研究院 360威胁情报中心 Sep 10, 2026, 12:30 PM",
      "page": 1,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p1-b05",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "APT-C-55",
      "page": 1,
      "section": "APT-C-55"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1-b06",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Kimsuky",
      "page": 1,
      "section": "Kimsuky"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1-b07",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "APT-C-55（Kimsuky）（又被称为 BabyShark 等）是一个长期针对韩国 的智囊团、政府外交部门、新闻媒体以及教育学术机构的高级持续性威胁组 织，网络攻击主要目的在…",
      "page": 1,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p1-b08",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "一、概述",
      "page": 1,
      "section": "一、概述"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1-b09",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "近期，360高级威胁研究院在日常情报挖掘中发现并捕获到了Kimsuky组织的攻击活 动，其采用多阶段加载方式，攻击者通过伪装的恶意安装包投递恶意 LNK 文件，利用 PowerSh…",
      "page": 1,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p1-b10",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "二、攻击活动分析",
      "page": 1,
      "section": "二、攻击活动分析"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1-b11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 1/18",
      "page": 1,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2-b12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2-b13",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "1.攻击流程分析",
      "page": 2,
      "section": "1.攻击流程分析"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2-b14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Kimsuky组织首先通过伪造的恶意安装包投递LNK文件，LNK利用自身隐藏数据解密 还原PowerShell恶意脚本。脚本启动后首先进行虚拟机、沙箱及安全分析环境检测，若 发现异…",
      "page": 2,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p2-b15",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "2.载荷投递分析",
      "page": 2,
      "section": "2.载荷投递分析"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2-b16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "本轮攻击行动中，Kimsuky组织利用安装包的方式投递恶意LNK载荷，后续LNK攻击 方式基本一致，故本次以恶意安装包为例进行分析，样本信息如下所示： MD5 04272144d33668f99f7cf2255289e351",
      "page": 2,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p2-b17",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "文件大小 5.66 MB (5934592字节)",
      "page": 2,
      "section": "文件大小 5.66 MB (5934592字节)"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2-b18",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "文件名 OrionQuests-Setup.exe",
      "page": 2,
      "section": "文件名 OrionQuests-Setup.exe"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2-b19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "该样本是一个.net程序，编译时间也被攻击者修改。受害者一旦点击运行安装，便会 从资源数据OrionSetup.payload.enc中提取有效载荷。",
      "page": 2,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p2-b20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 2/18",
      "page": 2,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p3-b21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p3-b22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "具体做法是读取base64编码的OrionSetup.payload.enc数据然后进行AES解密得到 压缩包数据。 接着对压缩包进行解压得到正常安装文件和恶意lnk文件并运行。",
      "page": 3,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p3-b23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 3/18",
      "page": 3,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "其中运行后打开的OrionLauncher程序安装页面如下，以迷惑用户。",
      "page": 4,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "lnk文件信息如下: MD5 3c64c75c9e6a3da7fbc766deb2081219",
      "page": 4,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b27",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "文件大小 22.89 KB (23439字节)",
      "page": 4,
      "section": "文件大小 22.89 KB (23439字节)"
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b28",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "文件名 guide.url.lnk",
      "page": 4,
      "section": "文件名 guide.url.lnk"
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Lnk携带base64编码的参数，如下所示：",
      "page": 4,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p4-b30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 4/18",
      "page": 4,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5-b31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5-b32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "解码后，其主要功能是从自身偏移读取指定大小的数据然后进行异或解密得到恶意 载荷并保存为powershell脚本执行。",
      "page": 5,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p5-b33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 5/18",
      "page": 5,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p6-b34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 6,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p6-b35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "脚本首先进行反分析检测，检查42个安全工具进程名（如idaq64、x64dbg、 ProcessHacker 、 Fiddler 等）和多种虚拟机环境标识 (VMware/QEMU…",
      "page": 6,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p6-b36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "然后通过计划任务伪装成“Google Chrome 更新”等方式实现持久化驻留。",
      "page": 6,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p6-b37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 6/18",
      "page": 6,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p7-b38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 7,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p7-b39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "接着通过Win32_ComputerSystem/Win32_OperatingSystem/Win32_Process收集计 算机名、域名、制造商、型号、内存、OS版本、所有进程信息,并将收集的系统信息通过 HTTP POST发送到http[:]//217.60.36.94/unicorn/mort.php。",
      "page": 7,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p7-b40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "样本在访问攻击者服务器过程中，针对InfinityFree免费主机的 JavaScript反机器人 验证机制进行了绕过。由于该服务器要求客户端执行JavaScript生成合法Coo…",
      "page": 7,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p7-b41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 7/18",
      "page": 7,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8-b42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 8,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8-b43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "回真实内容，样本通过下载服务器返回的验证脚本，并对其中浏览器执行逻辑进行修 改，将其转换为可由 Windows自带cscript工具执行的本地JavaScript，从而自动计算并 …",
      "page": 8,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p8-b44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "然后执行内嵌base64编码的数据，",
      "page": 8,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p8-b45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "该段脚本继续从服务器下载uni.txt数据。",
      "page": 8,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p8-b46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 8/18",
      "page": 8,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-b47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 9,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-b48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "uni.txt依然是powershell脚本，其功能继续从服务器下载test.bef_fri数据文件。",
      "page": 9,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-b49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "下载的test.bef_fri样本采用文件类型伪装技术（File Type Masquerading），通过将 文件头伪装为 RTF 格式，使其表面属性与实际用途不一致。该技术可降…",
      "page": 9,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-b50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 9/18",
      "page": 9,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p10-b51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 10,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p10-b52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "接着修复文件头进行解压缩得到真正的palyload，最后进行反射加载并执行.NET程 序集。",
      "page": 10,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p10-b53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 10/18",
      "page": 10,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11-b54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 11,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11-b55",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "3.攻击组件分析",
      "page": 11,
      "section": "3.攻击组件分析"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11-b56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "由test.bef_fri文件修复解压后得到载荷信息如下： MD5 7479bedf5813a1527199f8958e898d19",
      "page": 11,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p11-b57",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "文件大小 61.50KB (62976 字节)",
      "page": 11,
      "section": "文件大小 61.50KB (62976 字节)"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11-b58",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "文件名 test.bef_fri",
      "page": 11,
      "section": "文件名 test.bef_fri"
    },
    {
      "id": "p11-b59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "该载荷是一个经过高度混淆的C#模块化后门框架，采用了随机/乱码标识符、方法名 混淆以及大量无意义字符串拼接等手段来对抗静态分析。程序的入口位于 loader.Program.Mai…",
      "page": 11,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p11-b60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Program.Main 会在循环中创建 Socket，固定连接到 107.172.249.140:443。",
      "page": 11,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p11-b61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 11/18",
      "page": 11,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12-b62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 12,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p12-b63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "接着，样本收集系统信息（包括当前用户名、前台窗口标题、系统空闲时间、是否 是管理员等）经过AES加密发送到服务器。",
      "page": 12,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p12-b64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 12/18",
      "page": 12,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p13-b65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 13,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p13-b66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "建立加密通信通道后接收并执行控制端下发的指令。对于接收的数据进行头解析， 第一个字节是压缩标志（0表示无压缩，1表示LANT1压缩），其后四个字节表示数据长 度，然后进行AES解密…",
      "page": 13,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p13-b67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 13/18",
      "page": 13,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p14-b68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 14,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p14-b69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "若接收的指令数据为C#程序集，支持通过动态插件加载机制扩展功能，攻击者可根 据需要远程下发并加载不同插件，实现对受害主机执行更多恶意操作。",
      "page": 14,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p14-b70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 14/18",
      "page": 14,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p15-b71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9/12/26, 9:05 PM APT-C-55（Kimsuky）组织利用伪装安装包植入远控木马的攻击链分析",
      "page": 15,
      "section": null,
      "layout": "page_edge"
    },
    {
      "id": "p15-b72",
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "三、归属研判",
      "page": 15,
      "section": "三、归属研判"
    },
    {
      "id": "p15-b73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "经深度发现本次攻击方式和Kimsuky组织以往TTP存在较大关联，具体表现如下所 示： 1.本次攻击行动与我们之前关于Kimsuky组织的报告[1]中的载荷有较强相似度，甚 至可以…",
      "page": 15,
      "section": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p15-b74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9ilhH-WUqeNCStDfbrBsrw 15/18",
      "page": 15,
      "section": null,
